get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/messaging/health
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
**Messaging health**
Your account's messaging health, the same view as the portal Messaging tab: summary (numbers, messaging on, healthy, needing attention, in progress), campaigns with carrier-review progress, numbers needing attention (each with a plain-language title, detail and the actions that fix it: assign, disable, samples), 14 days of delivery counts (delivered, failed, blocked as spam, refused because the number is not enabled), and the alert-email setting. Updated hourly. Fix a number with PUT or DELETE /v2.2/numbers/{number}/messaging-campaign.

OperationId: `messagingHealth`
}
